      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the reply. the doctor's office is closed and i hate making appointments for everything. you said it might affect the efficacy of the aspirin... does that mean it won't work as well to protect my heart, or is it more about the stomach? i'm just worried about the stomach part mostly.",
