    "summary": "The user asks for guidance on whether they can take Advil (ibuprofen) while taking daily baby aspirin for heart health, specifically expressing concern about stomach irritation. The assistant provides advice that suggests taking the medications at different times of the day is a sufficient way to mitigate risk, while repeatedly including standard medical disclaimers.",
